name: ios-architecture
description: PickOne layering and implementation rules
---

# Layering

- Preserve `Presentation -> Domain -> Data`.
- Presentation talks only to use cases.
- Domain owns orchestration and business rules.
- Data owns DTOs, persistence, clients, and repository implementations.

# Boundaries

- DTOs never enter Domain.
- UI never talks directly to repositories.
- View models map domain entities and snapshots into presentation state.

# Recommendation Rule

- Recommendation outputs are candidates.
- Candidates must be enriched through `MovieRepository` before becoming final recommendations.
